---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About — Wevenue">
  <section class="min-h-screen pt-32 pb-24 flex items-center">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-8 bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-linear-to-r from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500">About</h1>

      <div class="text-left space-y-6 text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-lg">
        <p>
          Wevenue started as a joke — what if website builders didn't need drag-and-drop, templates, or learning curves? What if you just... told someone what you wanted?
        </p>
        <p>
          Turns out, AI agents can do that. Not perfectly yet, but close enough to be exciting. We're building a tool where your website is built through conversation, not configuration panels.
        </p>
        <p>
          The three agents (Pixel, Semicolon, Bugger) are personality-driven prompts for a single LLM — each one focuses on design, code quality, and testing respectively. In the future, they'll be more independent; for now, they're different lenses on the same model's capabilities.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-base">
          Built with Astro + Cloudflare Workers + your local Open WebUI. Free to run, free to deploy. Because good tools shouldn't cost a fortune.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12">
        <a href="/" class="inline-block bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3.5 rounded-xl transition text-lg">Back to Home</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
